44330       mat SUBS(UDIM(MAT ATTRIBUTESUBS))=ATTRIBUTESUBS
44340       mat TTIP$(UDIM(MAT ATTRIBUTETTIP$))=ATTRIBUTETTIP$
44350 ! 
44360       for INDEX=1 to UDIM(MAT SPEC$)
